Pro-Tips for your TileVerse Implementation:
Slug Usage: Ensure your frontend routing uses the slug property for SEO-friendly URLs (e.g., /tiles/obsidian-matte) rather than just the ID.

Image Paths: If you are using React or Next.js, make sure those images are placed in the public/images/tiles/ directory so the paths resolve correctly.

Filtering: Since your design shows "All Materials" buttons, you can use the category field in your JSON to filter the display list using a simple .filter() method in your code.

Price Display: I’ve included the price as a number so you can easily perform "Sort by Price" functionality. Don't forget to append the currency string in your UI!

